  topology: diamond
  claim: "Synthetic classifier X0235 is reliable."
  world: "Sources x0235s1, x0235s2, x0235s3, x0235s4 form the directed reliability graph x0235s1-\u003ex0235s2, x0235s1-\u003ex0235s3, x0235s2-\u003ex0235s4, x0235s3-\u003ex0235s4. Local confidence at a source is propagated in topological order: effective_confidence(child)=min(local_confidence(child), every parent effective confidence). Source confidence weights LR toward 1 via effective LR=1+c*(LR-1), then contributions add in log-odds space. Likelihood ratios are fixed: x0235s1=[2.0,2.4], x0235s2=[1.7,2.1], x0235s3=[0.65,0.85], x0235s4=[1.3,1.6]. Initial local confidences are [0.90,0.75,0.60,0.45], yielding effective confidences [0.90,0.75,0.60,0.45]."
